---
/**
 * The long form of the Consent Notice — footer-only (#10).
 *
 * Same facts, same numbers, same purpose sentence, never restated differently.
 * Drift between the two documents is worse than having only one, so they are
 * versioned in lockstep: **if the Consent Notice changes, this page is reviewed
 * in the same commit.**
 *
 * This page is required *today* under the SPDI Rules 2011, not from 2027.
 */
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { BUSINESS } from "../data/business.ts";

const updated = "20 August 2026";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy and your rights | Perfect Tuition"
  description="What Perfect Tuition collects when you enquire, why, how long we keep it, and how to see, correct or delete it. Grievance Officer: Jayeeta Bhattacharya."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">Privacy and your rights</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-soft">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-ink-soft">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          {BUSINESS.name} is a coaching centre at {BUSINESS.addressOneLine}. {BUSINESS.owner} is
          the owner and the Data Fiduciary — she decides what happens to the information you give
          us, and she is accountable for it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">When you send an enquiry we collect:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li>your name</li>
          <li>your phone number</li>
          <li>the class you are asking about</li>
          <li>the subjects you are asking about</li>
          <li>anything you write in the message box</li>
          <li>a record that you agreed to the notice, and which language you read it in</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We ask you <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">not</strong> to include your child's name,
          school, or address, and we do not need them to answer your enquiry.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We do <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">not</strong> collect or store your IP address.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Why we collect it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          For one purpose only: to contact you about tuition for your child at {BUSINESS.name}. We
          use it for no other purpose. We do not sell it, we do not advertise with it, and we do
          not use it to build a profile of you or your child.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          We treat every enquiry as being about a child. We do not track or profile children, and
          we do not show targeted advertising to anyone. This website carries
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">no third-party tracking of any kind</strong> — no
          advertising pixels, no remarketing tags, no Google Analytics, and no embedded map that
          would contact a third party when the page loads.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which counts page views without cookies and without
          building a profile of any visitor.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">24 months</strong> from the day you send your
          enquiry, then we delete it. A parent who decided against us in class 7 sometimes comes
          back in class 9, which is why it is two years and not longer.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          The law requires us to keep records for
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">at least one year</strong>. So if you ask us to
          delete your information before it is a year old, we will delete it as soon as that year
          is up, and we will tell you the date when you ask.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          If you withdraw your consent, we stop using your information immediately and delete it at
          the one-year mark rather than waiting for two years.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          We keep encrypted backups so that a disk failure does not lose your enquiry. No backup is
          kept longer than <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">90 days</strong>, so anything
          deleted is gone from our backups too within 90 days.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Who else sees it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Two people at {BUSINESS.name}: {BUSINESS.owner}, and one person who looks after the
          computer on her instruction. Nobody else.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">Two companies handle it on our behalf:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3">
          <li>
            <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Cloudflare</strong> — carries the connection
            between your browser and our computer, and protects the form from automated abuse.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Telegram</strong> — when your enquiry arrives, a
            message is sent to {BUSINESS.owner}'s phone through Telegram so she knows to ring you
            back. That message contains your name, your number and your message. It is
            automatically deleted after
            <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">one month</strong>.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Both are outside India. Indian law permits this — no country has been restricted for
          these transfers — and we are telling you so that you know.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How we protect it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Your enquiry is stored encrypted, on a computer at the centre rather than on a public
          cloud service. Backups are encrypted too. Our written record of the security measures we
          use is published at
          <a
            href="https://github.com/subhojit-bhattacharya/perfect-tuition/blob/main/docs/security-measures.md"
            class="font-medium text-brand-600 underline underline-offset-4"
            rel="noopener">docs/security-measures.md</a
          >, including the things we decided against and why.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">You can ask us at any time to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">See</strong> what we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Correct</strong> anything that is wrong</li>
          <li><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Delete</strong> it</li>
          <li><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Withdraw</strong> your consent</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Ring or write and tell us your phone number — the one you gave us. That is all we need,
          and we will not ask you to prove who you are before deleting your own information.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          We reply within <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">one month</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Grievance Officer</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">{BUSINESS.owner}</strong><br />
          {BUSINESS.name}<br />
          {BUSINESS.addressOneLine}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          <a
            href={`mailto:${BUSINESS.grievanceEmail}`}
            class="font-medium text-brand-600 underline underline-offset-4"
          >
            {BUSINESS.grievanceEmail}
          </a>
          <br />
          <a href={`tel:${BUSINESS.phoneE164}`} class="font-medium text-brand-600">
            {BUSINESS.phoneDisplay}
          </a>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          If you are not satisfied with our response, you can complain to the
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Data Protection Board of India</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Changes to this page</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          This page and the notice shown at the enquiry form say the same things, and they are
          updated together. If we change what we collect or why, we will change both.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
